flowchart TD
    E[Event Sources\nGitHub Actions / repo-gate / termux-smoke / Dependabot / runtime] --> I[Failure Ingestion\nnormalize / dedupe / correlate / fingerprint]
    I --> INC[Incident Model\nID / SHA / severity / evidence / authority]
    INC --> D[Diagnosis Engine]
    D --> P[Remediation Planner]
    P --> X[Dynamic Dispatcher]

    X --> CAP[Capability Matching]
    X --> AUTH[Authority / Policy Check]
    X --> AV[Availability / Workload]
    X --> MB[MoneyBall + 3L0 LeaderBoards\nmatrices / manager signals]
    CAP --> SEL[Worker Selection]
    AUTH --> SEL
    AV --> SEL
    MB --> SEL

    SEL --> GH[GitHub Worker]
    SEL --> TX[Termux Worker]
    SEL --> RW[Remote Worker]

    GH --> SB[Repair Sandbox]
    TX --> SB
    RW --> SB
    SB --> V[Verification\ntargeted tests / repo-gate / termux-smoke / security / regression]
    V -->|PASS| PG[Promotion Gate]
    V -->|FAIL| R[Retry / Re-diagnose / Escalate]
    R --> D
    PG -->|AUTO| M[Promote / Merge]
    PG -->|HITL| H[Human / Operator]
    M --> MON[Post-merge Monitor]
    H --> MON
    MON -->|REGRESSION| RB[Rollback / Escalate]
    MON -->|HEALTHY| RES[Resolved]
    RES --> K[Knowledge / Evidence]
    K --> D

    DB[Dependabot] --> I
    AZ[ArchW1z TUI] -. client projection .-> X
    DT[deepcli-TUI] -. client projection .-> X

    classDef p0 fill:none,stroke-width:3px;
